#. translators: 1: Expands to "Yoast SEO AMP".
#: yoastseo-amp.php:50
msgid "The %1$s plugin is no longer needed. Through good collaboration with Google the functionality of this plugin is now part of both Yoast SEO and the official AMP plugin. If you still have this plugin running we’d suggest updating both the Yoast SEO and AMP plugins and removing the glue plugin."
msgstr "The %1$s plugin is no longer needed. Through good collaboration with Google, the functionality of this plugin is now part of both Yoast SEO and the official AMP plugin. If you still have this plugin running, we’d suggest updating both the Yoast SEO and AMP plugins and removing the glue plugin."

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://yoast.com"
msgstr "https://yoast.com"

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Joost de Valk"
msgstr "Joost de Valk"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "Makes sure the default WordPress AMP plugin uses the proper Yoast SEO metadata"
msgstr "Makes sure the default WordPress AMP plugin uses the proper Yoast SEO metadata"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://wordpress.org/plugins/glue-for-yoast-seo-amp/"
msgstr "https://wordpress.org/plugins/glue-for-yoast-seo-amp/"

#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "Glue for Yoast SEO & AMP"
msgstr "Glue for Yoast SEO & AMP"